; The animation sandbox (tools/ghc.py sandbox). The game runs this file each
; time it is saved: edit, save, watch the hub. Its terminal prints each clip
; as it starts ([script] sandbox <clip>).
;
; Outfits: punk1 alterna1 glam1 goth1 metal1 rockabill1 rock1 deathmetal1
; classic funk1 grim; the 80s' punk3 alterna3 metal3 glam3 goth3 grim2; GH1's
; punkgh1 alternagh1 glamgh1 gothgh1 metalgh1 classicgh1 funk1gh1 grimgh1.
;
; Clips: any of the song set's by name (intro_02, stand_fast_01,
; extreme_medium_03, win_01, ...), shown as the pre-show would (back on its
; mark when it hands over); idle for the pre-show's idle; preshow_pick_1..
; for its picks (preshow_picks.dta). A clip the set lacks is skipped and
; named.

{sandbox_outfit glam1}
{sandbox_idle_secs 4}
{sandbox_loop (intro_03 idle stand_fast_01 idle stand_medium_04 idle)}

; {sandbox_characters hd}       HD models (sd back)
; {sandbox_auto}                the pre-show's own loop again
